1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,080
Fresh pizza dough gets rolled in sesame seeds and coated in flour.

2
00:00:05,339 --> 00:00:06,540
The crust gets formed.

3
00:00:08,140 --> 00:00:13,179
They stretch it out and toss it until it's basically the size of a freaking blanket.

4
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:19,559
On goes their house-made chunky vodka sauce, which gets spread all around the pie.

5
00:00:21,379 --> 00:00:23,780
Then into the oven it goes to look like this.

6
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:28,179
Now that the shell is formed, it's ready for their creamy penne alla vodka,

7
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:31,120
which they let me have the honor of casually pouring right on top.

8
00:00:32,119 --> 00:00:35,859
Once the pasta is evenly layered, they top it with a healthy amount of Parmesan cheese.

9
00:00:36,719 --> 00:00:39,439
Then comes their house-made sliced mozzarella cheese,

10
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:44,119
dealt out on every square inch of this pie like the most delicious deck of cards ever made.

11
00:00:44,899 --> 00:00:48,719
More vodka sauce in between each mozzarella slice, more Parmesan cheese,

12
00:00:49,079 --> 00:00:52,039
and into the oven one last time to look like this.

13
00:00:54,020 --> 00:00:55,399
Finished with parsley and sliced.

